    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Centrally located in the Golden Meadow retirement village and adjacent to the renowned Care Choice Nursing Home.\n\nThe property is on the outskirts of Clonakilty Town and within walking distance to Dunnes Stores. Golden Meadows is a 23 house development in a courtyard style. There is a large green area out to the back of the houses. Car parking is available closeby. Accommodation includes a hallway with door into the showeroom/WC and door to the large kitchen/dining/living room. From there there is a door out to the rear patio and double bedroom. The large double bedroom has a door back into the shower room/WC. There is electric heating and the house is furnished, ready to walk into. \n\n\nAccommodation c. 49 Sqm / 527 Sqft\n\nHall 2.6m x 1.65m\nWelcoming entrance hall and room behind the door for storage. Door into the kitchen living room or shower room.\n\nKitchen/Sitting Room 3.3 x 8.4 m \nSpacious room with dual aspect windows east and west. Lino flooring and glazed door to rear patio and green area. Fitted kitchen with oven, fridge, electric hob. There is a solid fuel stove in the sitting area adding to the comfort. Wall and ceiling fitted lighting.\n\nBedroom 2.8 x 5.3m\nFantastic ensuite double bedroom with dual aspect windows north and west. Carpeted floor and a fitted wardrobe. Door into shower room or sitting room.\n\nWC/Shower room 1.9m x 3.7m\nSpacious WC/shower room with doors to hall and bedroom. Non slip floor and walk in shower area/wet room. WC, wash hand basin and shower. There is a hot press/airing closet here also. \n\nOutside\nThere is unallocated car parking close to the front of the house. To the rear is a small patio area ideal for sitting out which leads on to the spacious, well-kept courtyard style green area.\n\nServices\nThe property is connected to all the main services including water, sewerage, telephone & electricity services. Heating is by means of electric heaters and there is a solid fuel stove in the sitting area. Windows are uPVC double glazed throughout and doors are timber double glazed.\n\nDirections\nLocated south of the N71 bypass road that skirts around the southern side of Clonakilty town to the rear of Care Choice Nursing Home. From the Cork side follow the bypass, beyond the entrance to the Park Hotel taking the next road left and 100 metres take another left into the Ladys Cross/Carechoice area. Type the Eircode P85 RK06 into a smartphone for the exact directions to the location.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Immaculately presented 1 bedroom bungalow within walking distance of Clonakilty Town </li><li> Beautifully kept courtyard style development with a large green area </li><li> Car parking is available close by </li><li> Centrally located in multi-award winning, cosmopolitan and welcoming seaside town of Clonakilty</li></ul>"
      },
